<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Merrill has 99.24 pct of McIntosh.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Merrill has 99.24 pct of McIntosh.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch and Co Inc said on Friday it held 99.24 percent of the issued shares of McIntosh Securities Ltd following the close of its takeover bid.</p>
<p>Merrill said it intended to compulsorily acquire the remaining shares in the Australian broker.</p>
<p>The Merrill offer of A$1.40 a share was unanimously recommended by McIntosh directors and valued the target company at A$117 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
